        "TileImage": "$($repository 3fac8d7f-ef90-43bd-82a7-6e58a369d713).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Dolores Powell, a former &apos;ICA&apos; handler.\rA few years back at the agency, Powell still handled Agent Jaguar. At one mission, a christmas party, Agent Jaguar tried to impersonate you, Agent 47.\rAgent Jaguar&apos;s underpreparement lead to a gas explosion, killing numerous civilians, which makes Powell indirectly responsible.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
